CORE
main.py
--unwind 6 --python-smt-containers --python-smt-strings --z3 --isolate-properties
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Run per property: since each assert is also assumed on the path after it
(PLR 7.3: a failed assert ends the program), the monolithic query carries
the pop-result equality as a hypothesis of the length check, which z3
4.8.12 does not decide in minutes (z3 5.4 takes 3 s, cvc5 4 s).
